SUMMARY:I Have No Pension... Did I Mention
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:I have no pension... Did I mention? Sally works full time as a 
 community nurse in Edinburgh and\, now aged 64\, she has realised that she 
 does not have enough pension. In a light-hearted and humorous musing\, she 
 explores the plight of women who frequently give up full-time work to take 
 on caring roles. 60 minutes of true stories of why Sally has no pension.\nM
